      "comment": "PAW ENSLEY (1) won again in an impressive display after running them ragged recording back to back wins, scoring at Traralgon over 350m (20.04). Has a solid record from this box including three wins and a minor placing. Can measure up again. BUSH MAYHEM (8) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (22.36) at this track behind Aston Newson in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. The form out of his last race has been franked. Must be included in calculations. OPAWA LEO (2) was below best at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth at The Meadows, but was among the placings at Addington three back. Can find the frame this time. COMPARE BUBBLE (3) can find the frame without surprising.",
